OL,3,GNEWSATrain services disrupted due to
OL,4,Asecurity alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain services have resumed following a
OL,7,Fsecurity alert in Lurgan, County
OL,8,FArmagh.
OL,10,FTranslink has advised passengers to
OL,11,Fallow for delays and disruption to
OL,12,Fservices on this line, which was closed
OL,13,Fbetween Belfast and Portadown with
OL,14,Freplacement bus services operating.
OL,16,FThe 12:00 BST Belfast Grand Central
OL,17,FStation to Dublin Connolly service did
OL,18,Fnot operate following the incident.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
