OL,3,GNEWSATrain services disrupted due to
OL,4,Asecurity alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,7,Fsaid they are investigating a report of
OL,8,Fsuspicious circumstances on Lake
OL,9,FStreet, Lurgan, on Friday night.
